# Generated IntelliSense compilation database - contains machine-specific
# absolute paths (your local Arduino15 install location, board FQBN, ...).
# Regenerate via the "Regenerate IntelliSense (compile_commands.json)" task
# in .vscode/tasks.json; the rest of .vscode/ (settings, task/config files)
# is portable and stays tracked.
.vscode/build/

# Arduino / PlatformIO build output, if you ever build somewhere other than
# arduino-cli's own temp/cache directories.
build/
.pio/
.pioenvs/
.piolibdeps/

# Editor/OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~
